ain"><div class="index-module-scss-module__mjCA1G__headerWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module__mjCA1G__headerContent"><div class="index-module-scss-module__mjCA1G__headerText"><h1 class="index-module-scss-module__mjCA1G__title">MEXC Fee Overview</h1><span>Explore trading, deposit, and withdrawal fees in one place</span></div></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__KAjpTa__contentWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module__KAjpTa__content"><div class="index-module-scss-module__S_6bba__feeInfoWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__cardWrapper index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__notLoginCardWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__titleWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__titleLeft"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__title"><span>Spot Trading Fee</span><svg class="mx-icon index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__questionCircleFilled" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-0.15em" viewBox="0 0 16 16" data-icon="IconFeeInfo"><path d="M7.99999 4.42749C8.47676 4.42749 8.86327 4.7931 8.86327 5.2441C8.86327 5.69509 8.47676 6.0607 7.99999 6.0607C7.52322 6.0607 7.13672 5.69509 7.13672 5.2441C7.13672 4.7931 7.52322 4.42749 7.99999 4.42749Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M8 12.0931C7.58579 12.0931 7.25 11.7573 7.25 11.3431V7.64111C7.25 7.2269 7.58579 6.89111 8 6.89111C8.41422 6.89111 8.75 7.2269 8.75 7.64111V11.3431C8.75 11.7573 8.41422 12.0931 8 12.0931Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15 8C15 11.866 11.866 15 8 15C4.13401 15 1 11.866 1 8C1 4.13401 4.13401 1 8 1C11.866 1 15 4.13401 15 8ZM13.5 8C13.5 4.96243 11.0376 2.5 8 2.5C4.96243 2.5 2.5 4.96243 2.5 8C2.5 11.0376 4.96243 13.5 8 13.5C11.0376 13.5 13.5 11.0376 13.5 8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__cardWrapper index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__notLoginCardWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__titleWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__titleLeft"><div class="index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__title"><span>Futures Trading Fee</span><svg class="mx-icon index-module-scss-module___S_AgG__questionCircleFilled" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-0.15em" viewBox="0 0 16 16" data-icon="IconFeeInfo"><path d="M7.99999 4.42749C8.47676 4.42749 8.86327 4.7931 8.86327 5.2441C8.86327 5.69509 8.47676 6.0607 7.99999 6.0607C7.52322 6.0607 7.13672 5.69509 7.13672 5.2441C7.13672 4.7931 7.52322 4.42749 7.99999 4.42749Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M8 12.0931C7.58579 12.0931 7.25 11.7573 7.25 11.3431V7.64111C7.25 7.2269 7.58579 6.89111 8 6.89111C8.41422 6.89111 8.75 7.2269 8.75 7.64111V11.3431C8.75 11.7573 8.41422 12.0931 8 12.0931Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15 8C15 11.866 11.866 15 8 15C4.13401 15 1 11.866 1 8C1 4.13401 4.13401 1 8 1C11.866 1 15 4.13401 15 8ZM13.5 8C13.5 4.96243 11.0376 2.5 8 2.5C4.96243 2.5 2.5 4.96243 2.5 8C2.5 11.0376 4.96243 13.5 8 13.5C11.0376 13.5 13.5 11.0376 13.5 8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__T1V2mq__tabsWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module__T1V2mq__spinWrapper"><div class="ant-spin ant-spin-spinning" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><span class="ant-spin-dot ant-spin-dot-spin"><i class="ant-spin-dot-item"></i><i class="ant-spin-dot-item"></i><i class="ant-spin-dot-item"></i><i class="ant-spin-dot-item"></i></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__KAjpTa__feeFooterWrapper"><div class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__feeDescWrapper"><h2>Understanding MEXC Fees</h2><div><h3>Maker Order</h3><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">An order placed at a specified price that enters the order book instead of matching immediately.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">Example: Current best ask is 100 USDT. A buy order placed at 99 USDT enters the order book until matched. When filled, maker fees apply.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">Maker fee rates may vary with platform events or user region. Please refer to the actual trade history.</p></div><div><h3>Taker Order</h3><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">An order that matches immediately with existing orders on the book.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">Example: Current best ask is 100 USDT. A buy order placed at 100 USDT matches immediately. When filled, taker fees apply.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">Taker fee rates may vary with platform events or user region. Please refer to the actual trade history.</p></div><div><h3>MX Deduction</h3><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">1. Spot Fee Deduction: Once enabled, MX tokens will be prioritized for fee deductions on Spot trades, granting a ‎0% discount. The discount becomes invalid once MX tokens are depleted.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">2. Futures Fee Deduction: Once enabled, users must transfer MX tokens to their Futures wallet. MX will then be prioritized for fee deductions on Futures trades, granting a ‎0% discount. The discount becomes invalid once MX tokens are depleted.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">3. Some trading pairs are excluded from MX fee deductions. For details, please refer to the fee schedule.</p><p class="index-module-scss-module__ZmFePG__text">4. Using MX tokens to offset trading fees directly is one of the convenient benefits we offer. This feature will be displayed based on your account&#x27;s eligibility. If you don&#x27;t see the relevant section on the fee page, it means this feature is not yet available for your account. Please refer to the fee page for the actual benefits.</p></div></div></div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class="remote-footer-container"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__top"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__section"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__title"><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-text"></span></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__qrcode"></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__download"></div></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__section"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__title"><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-text"></span><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-icon"></span></div><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li><a style="opacity:0" href="/privacypolicy"></a></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__section"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__title"><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-text"></span><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-icon"></span></div><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__section"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__title"><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-text"></span><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-icon"></span></div><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__section"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__title"><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-text"></span><span class="remote-footer-placeholder__title-icon"></span></div><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__bottom"><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__phone"></div><div class="remote-footer-placeholder__copyright"></div></div></div></div></div><script src="https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/3k4k08i66tg1o.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__nex