t photo.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• Only upload content that you own or have obtained legal authorization to use.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• Do not upload images involving:\u003cbr/\u003e\n   \u003cdiv\u003e - Celebrities or public figures\u003c/div\u003e\n   \u003cdiv\u003e - Political or government-related sensitive content\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv\u003e- Obscene, hate, harassment, or other inappropriate content\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv\u003e- Any copyrighted characters or brands (e.g. Disney)\u003c/div\u003e\n• If an upload does not meet the requirements above, you may be asked to upload a different image.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• Eligible users who complete the social media sharing and submit the required information via Google Forms will have a chance to participate in the prize draw. Rewards will be randomly distributed according to the event rules, but not all participants are guaranteed a prize.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• To remain eligible for rewards, please keep your social media post public until the rewards are distributed. If the post is deleted or made private before distribution,  the reward will not be granted. Please submit a screenshot of the post along with your UID, X profile link, and post link for verification.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• Rewards will be distributed in the form of XAUT (gold Spot tokens) to winners' MEXC accounts. Each winner will receive 50 USDT worth of XAUT.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• Rewards are expected to be distributed within 14 calendar days after the event ends.\u003cbr/\u003e\n• MEXC reserves the final right of interpretation for this event.62:[\"$\",\"$L63\",null,{\"formats\":\"$undefined\",\"locale\":\"en-US\",\"messages\":{\"common\":{\"mc_markets_chance_price_distribution_rise\":\"Rise: {riseCount}\",\"mc_markets_chance_price_distribution_fall\":\"Fall: {fallCount}\",\"mc_common_tabbar_markets\":\"Markets\",\"mc_common_mexc_exchange\":\"MEXC Exchange\",\"mc_common_nodata\":\"No data\",\"mc_exchange_kline_more\":\"More\",\"mc_common_visit_warning\":\"War