osit \u0026 Withdrawal Fee Rates\",\"mc_fee_special_text\":\"Special Rate\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_rate\":\"{value} MX Discount\",\"mc_fee_mx_discount_rate\":\"{value} Off for MX Holders\",\"mc_fee_has_mx_discount_text\":\"MEXC Fee Overview\",\"mc_fee_mc_fee_banner_title_desc\":\"Explore trading, deposit, and withdrawal fees in one place\",\"mc_fee_sign_up_now\":\"Sign Up Now\",\"mc_fee_level_text\":\"Fee Level\",\"mc_fee_Leverage\":\"Leverage\",\"mc_fee_maker_text\":\"Maker Order\",\"mc_fee_maker_text_desc\":\"\u003cp\u003eAn order placed at a specified price that enters the order book instead of matching immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExample: Current best ask is 100 USDT. A buy order placed at 99 USDT enters the order book until matched. When filled, maker fees apply.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMaker fee rates may vary with platform events or user region. Please refer to the actual trade history.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"mc_fee_taker_text\":\"Taker Order\",\"mc_fee_taker_text_desc\":\"\u003cp\u003eAn order that matches immediately with existing orders on the book.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExample: Current best ask is 100 USDT. A buy order placed at 100 USDT matches immediately. When filled, taker fees apply.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTaker fee rates may vary with platform events or user region. Please refer to the actual trade history.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduction\":\"MX Deduction\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_desc\":\"\u003cp\u003e1. Spot Fee Deduction: Once enabled, MX tokens will be prioritized for fee deductions on Spot trades, granting a {spotValue} discount. The discount becomes invalid once MX tokens are depleted.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Futures Fee Deduction: Once enabled, users must transfer MX tokens to their Futures wallet. MX will then be prioritized for fee deductions on Futures trades, granting a {contractValue} discount. The discount becomes invalid once MX tokens are depleted.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Some trading pairs are excluded from MX fee deductions. For details, please refer to the fee schedule.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"mc_fee_title_new\":\"Understanding MEXC Fees\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_eligibility_tip\":\"Using MX tokens to offset trading fees directly is one of the convenient benefits we offer. This feature will be displayed based on your account's eligibility. If you don't see the relevant section on the fee page, it means this feature is not yet available for your account. Please refer to the fee page for the actual benefits.\",\"mc_fee_get_discount\":\"Get {value} Off\",\"mc_fee_mx_button_buy_now\":\"Buy MX now for discounts\",\"mc_contract_exchange_risk_control_verification_title\":\"Security Verification\",\"mc_contract_exchange_fee_risk_control_verification_content\":\"Your Futures fee rate has been temporarily adjusted. Please click Proceed to Verify and follow the instructions to complete Risk Control Verification.\",\"mc_contract_exchange_risk_control_verification_button\":\"Proceed to Verify\",\"mc_fee_rate_info_text\":\"Fee Rate Details\",\"mc_fee_search_symbol_text\":\"Search Pairs\",\"mc_fee_deposit_withdrawal\":\"Deposit/Withdrawal\",\"mc_fee_spot\":\"Spot Trading Fee\",\"mc_fee_futures\":\"Futures Trading Fee\",\"mc_fee_deduct_spot_desc\":\"\u003cp\u003eWhen trading Spot, MX will be used to offset fees with a {value} discount.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSpot trading fees will be deducted from your Spot account's available MX balance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf your MX balance is insufficient, full fees will apply without discount.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"mc_fee_deduct_contract_desc\":\"\u003cp\u003eWhen trading Futures, MX will be used to offset fees with a {value} discount.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFutures trading fees will be deducted from your Futures account's available MX balance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf your MX balance is insufficient, full fees will apply without discount.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"mc_fee_fee_level_number\":\"Level {number}\",\"mc_fee_fee_tier\":\"Fee Tier\",\"mc_fee_affiliate_fee_rate\":\"Affiliate Fee Rate\",\"mc_fee_spot_fee_desc\":\"The displayed fee rate applies to the majority of trading pairs for the user. The actual fee rate may vary. A special fee rate refers to a rate where the user's actual fee differs from the standard base rate.\",\"mc_fee_zero_fee_desc\":\"Fees shown on this page are for standard users only and may not apply to institutions, market makers, projects, or API-based accounts\",\"mc_fee_current_discount\":\"Current Discount: \u003cspan\u003e{rate}\u003c/span\u003e\",\"mc_fee_tag_not_enjoy_mx_discount\":\"No MX Discount Applied\",\"mc_fee_discount_mx_rate\":\"Deduct using MX\",\"mc_fee_volume_deduct\":\"{value} Off\",\"mc_fee_enjoy_mx_deduct\":\"MX Holder Discount\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_finished\":\"Met\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_not_finished\":\"Not Met\",\"mc_fee_volume_discount\":\"{value} Off\",\"mc_fee_disable_mx_deduction\":\"Disable MX Deduction\",\"mc_fee_enable_mx_deduction\":\"Enable MX Deduction\",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_tip5\":\"3. The fee discount for holding MX in your spot account cannot be used in conjunction with MX Deduction. Priority is given to the MX spot holding discount.\",\"mc_fee_available_mx\":\"Available MX\",\"mc_fee_spot_should_buy\":\"The current available MX balance in the account is 0. We recommend that you buy some MX first.\",\"mc_fee_buy_now\":\"Buy Now\",\"mc_fee_futures_should_buy\":\"To enable MX Deduction for futures, you must transfer MX assets from your spot account to your futures account. Currently, you have an insufficient spot MX balance. Please purchase MX first.\",\"mc_fee_futures_mx_deduction_close_tip\":\"Once disabled, \u003cspan\u003ethe system will automatically transfer all the MX from your futures account to your spot account\u003c/span\u003e. You will no longer enjoy discounts by paying trading fees with MX for your futures trades later on.\",\"mc_fee_enable_now\":\"Enable Now\",\"mc_fee_futures_transfer_tip\":\"Transferring MX to your futures wallet will automatically enable MX Deduction for trading fee payment\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_table_snap_time\":\"Snapshot Time\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_table_snap_1\":\"First Snapshot\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_table_snap_2\":\"Second Snapshot\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_table_snap_3\":\"Third Snapshot\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_table_snap_total\":\"Total Valid Quantity\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_rules_tip\":\"You must meet these conditions to qualify:\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_quantity_title\":\"Valid MX Quantity Yesterday\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_quantity_tip_has_lock\":\"The MX snapshot quantity held yesterday, plus the MX quantity locked yesterday, is used to determine whether the requirement has been met. Due to the large amount of statistical data, if the valid quantity yesterday is below 10 MX, it will be excluded and displayed as 0.\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_quantity_tip\":\"The MX snapshot quantity held yesterday, plus the MX quantity locked yesterday, is used to determine whether the requirement has been met. Due to the large amount of statistical data, if the valid quantity yesterday is below 10 MX, it will be excluded and displayed as 0.\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_quantity_tip_detail\":\"Held {quantity} MX and {lockQuantity} locked MX yesterday\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_quantity_tip\":\"Just \u003cspan\u003e{quantity} MX\u003c/span\u003e more to meet the requirement\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_day_title\":\"Consecutive Holding Days\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_modal_day_tip\":\"Spot quantity is currently below the requirement\",\"mc_fee_mx_deduct_spot_day_tip\":\"Continue holding for \u003cspan\u003e{day}\u003c/span\u003e more days to meet the requirement\",\"mc_fee_view_mx_position_snapshot\":\"View MX Snapshots\",\"mc_fee_withdrawal_fee_rates\":\"Withdrawal Fee\",\"mc_fee_view_more\":\"View More\",\"mc_fee_deduct_disable_not_discount\":\"Not eligible as MX deduction is disabled\",\"mc_fee_position_not_reach_discount\":\"Not eligible due to insufficient MX holdings\",\"mc_fee_trading_pair\":\"Trading Pair\",\"mc_assets_spot\":\"Spot Account\",\"mc_assets_contract\":\"Futures Account\",\"mc_assets_transfer_amount\":\"Please enter the quantity\",\"mc_assets_transfer_amount_reg_2\":\"Please enter the correct quantity\",\"mc_assets_transfer_amount_reg\":\"Transfer quantity cannot be more than the balance\",\"mc_contract_exchange_reverse\":\"COIN-M\",\"mc_futures_market_type\":\"{coin}-M Futures\",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_hold\":\"Close\",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_cancel\":\"Not Yet\",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_sure\":\"Enable\",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_cancel_confirm\":\"Are you sure you want to forgo your MX trading fee discount? \",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_cancel_tip\":\"By disabling this function, you will no longer be entitled to the MX trading fee discount. \",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_tip1\":\"1. After enabling, when conducting spot trading, priority will be given to using MX for fee deductions, and you will enjoy a {spotRatio} discount.\",\"mc_user_fee_mx_deduction_tip2\":\"2. If your MX balance is insufficient for the trading fee payment, the system will automatically apply the platform's default fee rate.\",\"mc_alpha_newest\":\"Latest\",\"mc_alpha_header_title\":\"Alpha\",\"mc_common_deposit\":\"Deposit\",\"mc_common_copy_success\":\"Copied successfully\",\"mc_exchange_kline_price_setting\":\"Candlestick Opening Price\",\"mc_common_refresh\":\"Refresh\",\"mc_common_know_new\":\"OK\",\"mc_common_nav_exchange\":\"Spot\",\"mc_common_etf_long\":\"Long\",\"mc_common_etf_short\":\"Short\",\"mc_common_transfer\":\"Transfer\",\"mc_common_check\":\"View\",\"mc-trade-zone-0fees\":\"0 Fees\",\"mc_common_24_highest_price\":\"24H High\",\"mc_common_24_lowest_price\":\"24H Low\",\"mc_common_24_amount\":\"24h Vol\",\"mc_common_introduce\":\"Details\",\"mc_exchange_symbols_24h_rate\":\"24H Change\",\"mc_common_change_week\":\"Weekly Change\",\"mc_common_assess\":\"Assessment\",\"mc_common_modal_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"mc_common_type\":\"Type\",\"mc_common_more\":\"more\",\"mc_common_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"mc_common_vol\":\"Vol\",\"mc_common_time\":\"Time\",\"mc_common_message_check_all\":\"View All\",\"mc_exchange_market_suggest\":\"Market\",\"mc_common_volume\":\"Volume\",\"mc_common_nav_margin\":\"Margin\",\"mc_common_reset\":\"Reset\",\"mc_common_filters\":\"Filters\",\"mc_common_save\":\"Save\",\"mc_common_kline\":\"Chart\",\"mc_common_loading\":\"Loading...\",\"mc_etf_intro_tab_2\":\"3X ETF\",\"mc_etf_intro_tab_3\":\"4X ETF\",\"mc_etf_intro_tab_4\":\"5X ETF\",\"mc_etf_intro_tab_5\":\"2X ETF\",\"mc_market_calendar\":\"Calendar\",\"mc_exchange_symbol_change_title\":\"Trading Pairs Data Updated\",\"mc_exchange_symbol_change_content\":\"Trading pairs data has just been updated. You can refresh to obtain the latest trading pair data.\",\"mc_exchange_coin_change_title\":\"Crypto Renaming Reminder\",\"mc_exchange_coin_change_content\":\"The trading pair you are currently viewing has been renamed\",\"mc_exchange_no_result\":\"No results. Go to {name} market to add your favorite tokens.\",\"mc_exchange_contract_reverse\":\"COIN-M\",\"mc_market_seo_crypto_spot_pairs\":\"{categoryName} Crypto Market \u0026 Spot Trading Pairs | Prices, Charts \u0026 Liquidity | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_browse_tokens\":\"Browse {categoryName} category tokens, compare real-time prices and trading depth, and start secure spot trading on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_token_market\":\"{tokenShortName} Related Market: Token Price, Market Data \u0026 Spot Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_token_data\":\"View {tokenShortName} related spot market tokens, price, market cap, and more. Compare competing crypto and trade securely in the MEXC Spot Market.\",\"mc_market_seo_spot_market\":\"Crypto Spot Market: All Crypto Trading Pairs and Token Overview | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_market_overview\":\"Browse the full crypto spot market on MEXC. View live token prices, charts, and 24H trading volume for all crypto trading pairs. Start secure and fast spot trading today.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_category_generic\":\"{tokenShortName} {categoryName} Perpetual Futures: {categoryName} Market \u0026 Futures Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_category_generic\":\"Browse the {tokenShortName} Perpetual Futures market under the {categoryName} sector, check liquidity and funding rates, and trade {categoryName} contracts with leverage on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_markets_futures_usdt_m\":\"USDT-M Futures Market: Live Token Prices, Funding Rates \u0026 Leverage Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_markets_futures_usdt_m\":\"Trade USDT-margined perpetual futures with deep liquidity and responsive execution. Track token live prices, funding rates, open interest, and market volatility on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_markets_futures_usdc_m\":\"USDC-M Futures Trading: Real-Time Price \u0026 Market Depth | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_markets_futures_usdc_m\":\"Access USDC-margined perpetual futures markets with live pricing and strong liquidity. Monitor price charts and funding rates while trading securely on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_markets_futures_coin_m\":\"Coin-M Futures Market: Crypto-Settled Futures Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_markets_futures_coin_m\":\"Trade coin-margined perpetual futures settled directly in cryptocurrency. Track Coin-M trading pair data, funding rates, and liquidity across major crypto assets on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_title1\":\"Cryptocurrency Markets | Explore Crypto Prices | Trade Crypto | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_description1\":\"Explore MEXC Markets for real-time prices, high liquidity, and deep order books. Gain access to a diverse range of spot and futures markets. Trade popular crypto pairs such as BTC or ETH and discover trending tokens.\",\"mc_market_seo_crypto_buy\":\"Buy Crypto Marketplace: OTC \u0026P2P Trading for All Supported Tokens | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_otc_p2p\":\"Buy cryptocurrencies using fiat currency through MEXC’s OTC \u0026P2P marketplace. Access all supported tokens, secure settlement, verified merchants, and fast payment options across global markets.\",\"mc_market_seo_stocks_market_title\":\"US Stock Market: Trade TSLA, NVDA, MSFT \u0026 More with USDT | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_stocks_market_description\":\"Trade US stocks like AAPL, GOOGL, META, and other top-performing equities on MEXC with USDT. Enjoy low fees, deep liquidity, and fast execution while exploring a wide range of US stock opportunities.\",\"mc_market_seo_best_spot_pairs\":\"Best Crypto Spot Trade Pairs Today | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_trending_spot\":\"Explore featured spot trading markets on MEXC. Track trending tokens, high-liquidity pairs, real-time price movements, and market momentum.\",\"mc_market_seo_alpha_market\":\"Alpha Discovery Market: Explore Emerging Crypto Assets \u0026 Early-Stage Token | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_alpha_assets\":\"Browse all emerging and early-stage crypto assets in the Alpha Market on MEXC. Track market discovery signals, real-time liquidity shifts, and new sector growth trends.\",\"mc_market_favourite\":\"Favorites\",\"mc_market_crypto\":\"Crypto\",\"mc_market_fiat_nav_title\":\"Fiat\",\"mc_markets_stocks_tab\":\"Stocks\",\"mc_exchange_change_1min\":\"1m Change\",\"mc_exchange_change_1h\":\"1h Change\",\"mc_exchange_change_1mon\":\"30D Change\",\"mc_exchange_change_1y\":\"1Y Change\",\"mc_exchange_fav_list_edit\":\"Favorites\",\"mc_exchange_fav_group_edit\":\"Groups\",\"mc_exchange_move_to_group\":\"Move To Group\",\"mc_exchange_new_group\":\"New Group\",\"mc_exchange_edit_group_name\":\"Edit Group Name\",\"mc_exchange_added_to_group\":\"Added to Group\",\"mc_exchange_auto_add_fav_success\":\"Added to favorites. You may proceed to edit the group.\",\"mc_markets_stocks_turnover\":\"Turnover\",\"mc_markets_stocks_code\":\"Code\",\"mc_markets_stocks_volume\":\"V