ee trading for designated {tokenShortName} Perpetual Futures, and enjoy high liquidity and low-cost execution for your futures.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_meme\":\"{tokenShortName} Meme Coin Perpetual Futures Market: Meme Token Futures Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_meme\":\"Trade popular {tokenShortName} Meme Coin Perpetual Futures on MEXC. Monitor the futures sentiment, price changes, and funding rate dynamics in the meme market.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_cex_token\":\"{tokenShortName} Platform Token Perpetual Futures: CEX Token Contract Trading | MEXC Futures\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_cex_token\":\"Check {tokenShortName} Platform Token Perpetual Futures market data and funding rates, and efficiently execute CEX token contract trades on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_chinese_labeled\":\"{tokenShortName} Chinese-Labeled Futures Market: Chinese-Labeled Trading Pairs and Perpetual Futures | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_chinese_labeled\":\"Browse {tokenShortName} Perpetual Futures for Chinese-Labeled, view real-time price charts, and trade the corresponding Chinese-Labeled futures pairs on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_ai\":\"{tokenShortName} AI Sector Perpetual Futures: Trade AI Themed Crypto Token Contracts | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_ai\":\"Trade {tokenShortName} Perpetual Futures related to the AI sector, track sector sentiment and market trends, and execute futures trading for AI-related cryptocurrencies.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_rwa\":\"{tokenShortName} RWA Perpetual Futures Trading: Real World Asset Futures | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_rwa\":\"Trade {tokenShortName} Perpetual Futures for RWA-related tokens. Check the price volatility and funding rate dynamics of Real World Asset futures on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_title_template_solana_ecosystem\":\"{tokenShortName} Solana Ecosystem Perpetual Futures: Trade SOL and Ecosystem Tokens | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_description_template_solana_ecosystem\":\"Trade {tokenShortName} SOL and Solana Ecosystem Perpetual Futures on MEXC, view price trends and funding rates, and access reliable market depth.\",\"mc_market_seo_main_market_title\":\"Spot Main Market: Leading Crypto Assets, Most Popular Tokens | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_main_market_desc\":\"Trade major and high-liquidity crypto assets in the Main Market on MEXC. View real-time token price charts and start trading instantly.\",\"mc_market_seo_tokenized_stocks_title\":\"Tokenized Stocks Trading Market: Most Popular Tokenized Assets | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_tokenized_stocks_desc\":\"Access tokenized stock assets and trade fractional equity-backed tokens directly on MEXC. Trade stocks such as NVDAX, AAPLX, TSLAX, and more.\",\"mc_market_seo_zero_fees_title\":\"Zero Fee Spot Market: Trade Top Tokens With 0 Fees | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_zero_fees_desc\":\"Trade select crypto spot pairs with zero trading fees on MEXC. Enjoy cost-efficient trading with deep liquidity.\",\"mc_market_seo_new_listing_title\":\"New Tokens Market: Newly Listed Crypto Spot Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_new_listing_desc\":\"Discover newly listed cryptocurrencies on MEXC. Track fresh spot market tokens with real-time price updates and volumes.\",\"mc_market_seo_stablecoins_title\":\"Stablecoins Market: Trade USDT, USDC, FDUSD, and More | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_stablecoins_desc\":\"Compare stablecoins prices, trade USDT, USDC, FDUSD, and other pegged assets on MEXC. Access deep liquidity, real-time charts, and secure spot trading with fast execution.\",\"mc_market_seo_privacy_coins_title\":\"Privacy Coins Market: Privacy Token Spot Trading and Overview | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_privacy_coins_desc\":\"Explore privacy-focused cryptocurrencies including XMR, ZEC and other anonymity-preserving assets. View real-time market data and trade securely on MEXC Spot.\",\"mc_market_seo_rwa_title\":\"RWA (Real-World Asset) Token Market: Asset-Backed Crypto Spot Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_rwa_desc\":\"Trade RWA tokens tied to real-world assets and economic value. Track market trends, token price fluctuations, and liquidity across the RWA sector on MEXC Spot.\",\"mc_market_seo_cex_token_title\":\"CEX Token Market: Exchange and Platform Tokens Spot Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_cex_token_desc\":\"Compare performance and trade major exchange tokens including MX, BNB, OKB, BGB, and more. Track price charts and liquidity on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_category_market\":\"{categoryName} | {tokenShortName} Market Price, Charts \u0026 Spot Trading | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_category_assets\":\"Browse crypto assets in the {categoryName} group and {tokenShortName} spot tokens. View real-time prices, charts, depth, and market cap data. Compare similar assets on the MEXC Spot Market and start trading securely and easily.\",\"mc_market_seo_metals_title\":\"Metals Market: Trade Tokenized Gold, Silver, and Popular Metals | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_metals_desc\":\"Explore Metals trading zone on MEXC to view tokenized metal assets such as gold and silver, along with real-time market data. Trade popular commodity-backed metal tokens on MEXC with low fees and fast execution.\",\"mc_market_seo_oil_title\":\"Oil Markets: Trade WTI, Brent Oil and Other Oil-Related Assets | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_oil_desc\":\"Trade crude oil markets on MEXC, including WTI and Brent oil instruments. Access real-time price data, deep liquidity, and seamless exposure to global oil markets.\",\"mc_market_seo_best_futures_pairs\":\"Best Crypto Futures Trade Pairs Today | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_activity\":\"Monitor high-activity perpetual futures markets with strong liquidity and active funding rate movements. Identify leading futures pair and trade efficiently on MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_alpha_listings\":\"Latest Alpha Market Listings: Newly Added Emerging Crypto Assets | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_new_tokens\":\"Explore the newest tokens added to the Alpha Market. Identify early listings, monitor initial liquidity formation, and analyze early market behavior for discovery-stage assets.\",\"mc_market_seo_heat_map\":\"Crypto Market Heat Map: Real-Time Volume \u0026 Price Change for Futures Contracts | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_futures_heatmap\":\"Use MEXC’s heat map tool to instantly visualize real-time trading volume and price changes across futures markets. Identify active contracts, market hotspots, and emerging sentiment with intuitive colour-coded blocks.\",\"mc_market_seo_data_reference\":\"Crypto Market Data Reference: Token Rankings, Price Change Distribution, Trading Volume Insights | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_market_insights\":\"Explore market data on MEXC including token rankings, price-change distribution charts, trading volume breakdowns, and popular token zones. Stay updated on market changes and crypto trends.\",\"mc_market_seo_market_alerts\":\"Market Change Alerts \u0026 Trading Signals: Notable Price Movements, Large Orders \u0026 Token Breakthroughs | MEXC\",\"mc_market_seo_trading_signals\":\"Stay informed of significant market changes on MEXC including large buy/sell orders, token breakthroughs, historical price shifts and other trigger events across spot and futures markets.\",\"mc_market_seo_keywords1\":\"Crypto Price, Token Price, Crypto Markets, Bitcoin Price, Ethereum Price\",\"mc_market_seo_og_title\":\"MEXC Markets | Trade Most Trending Tokens with Extremely Low Fees and Comprehensive Liquidity\",\"mc_market_seo_og_description\":\"Discover MEXC Markets and trade the most popular crypto pairs with deep liquidity and real-time pricing. Maximize your trading potential with MEXC.\",\"mc_market_seo_twitter_title\":\"MEXC Markets | Trade Most Trending Tokens with Extremely Low Fees and Comprehensive Liquidity\",\"mc_market_seo_twitter_description\":\"Discover MEXC Markets and trade the most popular crypto pairs with deep liquidity and real-time pricing. Maximize your trading potential with MEXC.\",\"mc_exchange_order_state_not_triggered\":\"Untriggered\",\"mc_exchange_order_state_new\":\"Uncompleted\",\"mc_exchange_order_state_partially_filled\":\"Partially filled\",\"mc_exchange_order_state_partially_canceled\":\"Partial cancelation\",\"mc_table_status_submit_pending\":\"Submitting\",\"mc_table_status_cancel_pending\":\"Canceling\",\"mc_table_trigger_status_executed\":\"Executed\",\"mc_table_trigger_status_failed\":\"Failed\",\"mc_exchange_limit\":\"Limit\",\"mc_exchange_postonly\":\"Post only\",\"mc_exchange_ioc\":\"IOC\",\"mc_exchange_fok\":\"FOK\",\"mc_exchange_trigger\":\"TP/SL\",\"mc_exchange_oco_order_trigger\":\"OCO-Stop-limit\",\"mc_exchange_oco_order_limit\":\"OCO-Limit\",\"mc_exchange_track_label\":\"Trailing Stop\",\"mc_exchange_oco\":\"OCO\",\"mc_exchange_confirm_cancel_all_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all?\",\"mc_order_entrust_limit\":\"Limit order\",\"mc_exchange_confirm_cancel_limit_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all limit orders?\",\"mc_exchange_confirm_cancel_limit_more_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all limit/market orders?\",\"mc_exchange_confirm_cancel_trigger_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all stop-limit orders?\",\"mc_exchange_oco_confirm_cancel_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all OCO orders?\",\"mc_exchange_confirm_cancel_postonly_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all Post only orders?\",\"mc_exchange_confirm_cancel_track_tips\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel all trailing stop orders?\",\"mc_exchange_macro_currency_policy\":\"Currency Policy\",\"mc_exchange_macro_economic_data\":\"Economic Data\",\"mc_exchange_macro_bond_indices\":\"Bond Indices\",\"mc_exchange_macro_precious_metals\":\"Precious Metals\",\"mc_exchange_macro_industry_updates\":\"Industry Updates\",\"mc_exchange_macro_on_chain_data\":\"On-chain Data\",\"mc_exchange_macro_expert_insights\":\"Expert Insights\",\"mc_exchange_place_success\":\"Ordered successfully\",\"mc_market_ai_list_long_short_ai_analysis\":\"Long/Short \u0026 AI Analysis\",\"mc_market_ai_list_long_short\":\"Long/Short\",\"mc_market_ai_list_ai_analysis\":\"AI Analysis\",\"mc_market_ai_list_disclaimer\":\"This page contains AI-generated content based on publicly available information. It has not been verified and is for reference only. It does not constitute investment advice. MEXC does not provide financial advisory services. Please consult a professional before making investment decisions.\",\"mc_market_ai_list_bullish\":\"Bullish\",\"mc_market_ai_list_bearish\":\"Bearish\",\"mc_common_closed\":\"Closed\",\"mc_spot_usst_compliance_rejected_tip\":\"Submit Documents to Start RealStocks Trading\",\"mc_markets_stocks_real_stocks_tab\":\"RealStocks\",\"mc_markets_stocks_tokenized_stocks_tab\":\"Tokenized Stocks\",\"mc_markets_usstock_open_now\":\"Open Stock Account\",\"mc_markets_usstock_open_guide\":\"Open your Stock account to track market moves\",\"mc_markets_usstock_open_action\":\"Open Account\",\"mc_markets_usstock_open_to_track_market\":\"Open your Stock account to track market moves\",\"mc_markets_stocks_real_stocks_title\":\"RealStocks Market: Trade TSLA, NVDA, MSFT \u0026 More | MEXC\",\"mc_markets_stocks_real_stocks_desc\":\"Trade RealStocks like AAPL, GOOGL, META, and other top-performing equities on MEXC. Enjoy low fees, deep liquidity, and fast execution while exploring a wide range of RealStocks opportunities.\",\"mc_markets_stocks_tokenized_stocks_title\":\"Tokenized Stocks Trading Market: Most Popular Tokenized Assets | MEXC\",\"mc_markets_stocks_tokenized_stocks_desc\":\"Access tokenized stocks assets and trade fractional equity-backed tokens directly on MEXC. Trade tokenized stocks such as NVDAX, AAPLX, TSLAX, and more.\",\"mc_markets_chance_tab_name\":\"Prospects\",\"mc_fee_stock_fees_title\":\"MEXC RealStocks Trading Fees\",\"mc_fee_stock_fees_desc\":\"Trade all U.S. stocks on MEXC RealStocks with 0 commissions and 0 platform fees. Promotion end date to be announced. Terms and conditions apply.\",\"mc_markets_chance_disclaimer\":\"Relevant data is for reference only and does not constitute investment advice.\",\"mc_markets_chance_btc_trend_forecast_title\":\"BTC Trend Forecast\",\"mc_markets_chance_price_distribution_title\":\"Price-change Distribution\",\"mc_markets_chance_heatmap_title\":\"Heatmap\",\"mc_markets_chance_futures_rewards_title\":\"Trade Futures to Win Rewards\",\"mc_markets_chance_hot_sectors_title\":\"Hot Sectors\",\"mc_markets_chance_long_short_position_title\":\"Futures Long-Short Ratio\",\"mc_markets_chance_explanation_popup_title\":\"Futures Long-Short Ratio\",\"mc_markets_chance_explanation_popup_btn\":\"Got It\",\"mc_markets_chance_explanation_popup_content\":\"The long-short ratio is based on real-time platform statistics and is for reference only. The tokens listed below are the top five by trading volume over the past 24 hours and are dynamically adjusted based on market activity.\",\"mc_markets_chance_long_short_ratio_label\":\"Long-Short Ratio\",\"mc_markets_chance_vote_success_tip\":\"Voted successfully! You can participate again tomorrow.\",\"mc_markets_chance_vote_prompt\":\"How do you feel about BTC's price movement today?\",\"mc_markets_chance_btn_bullish\":\"Bullish\",\"mc_markets_chance_btn_bearish\":\"Bearish\",\"mc_markets_chance_signup_desc\":\"During the event, register and trade on the specified trading pairs for a chance to share the prize pool.\",\"mc_markets_chance_btn_signup\":\"Sign Up Now\",\"mc_markets_chance_vote_popup_majority\":\"Your vote is in!\u003cbr/\u003eThe majority has spoken\",\"mc_markets_chance_vote_popup_minority\":\"Your vote is in!\u003cbr/\u003eSometimes, the truth lies with the minority\",\"mc_markets_chance_popup_go_long\":\"Go Long\",\"mc_markets_chance_popup_go_short\":\"Go Short\",\"mc_markets_chance_tab_new\":\"New\",\"mc_markets_chance_tab_hot\":\"Hot\",\"mc_markets_chance_signup_success_toast\":\"Registered successfully\",\"mc_markets_chance_prize_pool_subtitle\":\"Total Prize Pool: {reward}\",\"mc_markets_chance_tag_initial\":\"Initial Listing\",\"mc_markets_chance_view_more_pairs\":\"View More Pairs\",\"mc_markets_chance_subtitle_holders_ratio\":\"Long-Short Holders Ratio\",\"mc_markets_chance_label_long\":\"Long\",\"mc_markets_chance_label_short\":\"Short\",\"mc_markets_chance_data_timestamp\":\"Data Timestamp: {date}\",\"mc_markets_chance_active_buy_popup_title\":\"Active Buy\",\"mc_markets_chance_active_sell_popup_title\":\"Active Sell\",\"mc_markets_chance_active_buy_popup_content\":\"Active buy volume (USDT) for {symbol} perpetual Futures in the past hour\",\"mc_markets_chance_active_sell_popup_content\":\"Active sell volume (USDT) for {symbol} perpetual Futures in the past hour\",\"mc_common_confirm_tip\":\"Tips\",\"mc_common_know\":\"OK\",\"mc_common_sign_login_in_sign_up\":\"Sign Up / Log In\",\"mc_common_hide\":\"Collapse\",\"mc_common_download\":\"Download\",\"mc_common_share_text\":\"Share\",\"mc_common_quantity\":\"Volume\",\"mc_common_nav_login\":\"Log In\",\"mc_common_nav_register_and_login\":\"Sign Up/Log in\",\"mc_common_detail\":\"Info\",\"mc_exchange_trade_now\":\"Trade Now\",\"mc_exchange_symbols_quantity\":\"Volume\",\"mc_common_countdown_hours\":\"H\",\"mc_common_countdown_minute\":\"M\",\"mc_common_countdown_seconds\":\"S\",\"mc_market_heat_map_price_invite_code\":\"Referral Code\",\"mc_market_heat_map_price_share_tips\":\"Enjoy the lowest trading fees. Sign up now!\",\"mc_market_heat_map_rise_fall_24\":\"24H Change\",\"mc_market_heat_map_crypto_top\":\"Top {value} Crypto\",\"mc_market_heat_map_timezone_rate_change-setting-app\":\"Time Zone Settings\",\"mc_market_heat_map_timezone_rate_change_tip\":\"When you adjust the start time settings for price changes here, the system will update the data on other webpages (such as the trading page, market page, homepage, etc.) simultaneously, ensuring your settings remain synchronized across the website.\",\"mc_market_heat_map_timezone_rate_change-setting\":\"Time Zone Settings (Synced across webpages)\",\"mc_market_heat_map_price_change\":\"Price Change Annotations\",\"mc_invite_head_title\":\"Invite Friends for Super Rewards | MEXC Exchange\",\"mc_zero_fee_banner_min_screen_title\":\"0 Fee Fest\",\"mc_zero_fee_banner_min_screen_sub_title\":\"Trade 100 pairs with 0 fees\",\"mc-zero-fee-fiat-gateways\":\"Fiat Gateways\",\"mc-zero-fee-p2p\":\"P2P\",\"mc_zero_fee_trade_zero_fee\":\"0-fee trading\",\"mc-zero-fee-countdown-column-title_h5\":\"Pair/Starts In\",\"mc-zero-fee-countdown-column-title\":\"Starts In\",\"mc_zero_fee_buy_crypto\":\"Fiat\",\"mc_zero_fee_not_logged_in\":\"Not Logged In\",\"mc_zero_fee_not_logged_in_desc\":\"Enjoy 0-fee trading for a limited time. Log in to view eligible tokens.\",\"mc_zero_fee_login_guide_tip_title\":\"Not Logged In\",\"mc_zero_fee_login_guide_tip_desc\":\"Please log in to view the 0-fee trading pairs available in your country/region.\",\"mc_zero_fee_login_guide_tip_button\":\"Log In\",\"mc_zero_fee_empty_tip_title\":\"Not currently supported\",\"mc_zero_fee_empty_tip_desc\":\"Sorry, your country/region currently does not support 0-fee trading\",\"mc_zero_fee_empty_tip_button\":\"Trade Futures\",\"mc_zero_fee_not_open_contract_account\":\"Futures Not Activated\",\"mc_zero_fee_not_open_contract_account_desc\":\"Activate Futures: Get 0-Fee Trading\",\"mc_zero_fee_open_contract_account\":\"Activate Futures\",\"mc-zero-fee-saved-fees-30-days\":\"30-Day Fees Saved\",\"mc-zero-fee-saved-fees-total\":\"Total Fees Saved\",\"mc-zero-fee-view-detail\":\"Details\",\"mc_zero_fee_tiered_used_available_title\":\"Used/Available 0-Fee Trading Volume\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_table_col_exchange\":\"Exchange\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_table_col_spot_maker\":\"Spot Maker\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_table_col_spot_taker\":\"Spot Taker\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_table_col_futures_maker\":\"Futures Maker\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_table_col_futures_taker\":\"Futures Taker\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_volume_col_monthly\":\"Monthly Volume\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_volume_col_mexc\":\"MEXC (0 Fee)\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_volume_col_fee_01\":\"0.1% Maker Fee\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_volume_col_fee_06\":\"0.6% Taker Fee\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_title\":\"FAQ\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q1_question\":\"What does zero-fee crypto trading mean?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q1_answer\":\"Zero-fee crypto trading means you pay \u003ca\u003e0% in trading fees\u003c/a\u003e when buying or selling eligible cryptocurrency pairs. On MEXC, this applies to both maker and taker orders on all Spot trading pairs and 100+ Futures pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q2_question\":\"Which trading pairs are eligible for zero trading fees?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q2_answer_p1\":\"MEXC offers 0% trading fees across two categories:\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q2_answer_p2\":\"Spot Trading: All Spot trading pairs on MEXC carry 0% maker and taker fees. This includes major tokens like \u003cbtcLink\u003eBTC/USDT\u003c/btcLink\u003e, \u003cethLink\u003eETH/USDT\u003c/ethLink\u003e, \u003csolLink\u003eSOL/USDT\u003c/solLink\u003e, \u003cxrpLink\u003eXRP/USDT\u003c/xrpLink\u003e, and thousands more across 3,000+ listed tokens.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q2_answer_p3\":\"Futures Trading: Trade 100+ selected Futures pairs with 0% maker and 0% taker fees in the \u003czeroFeeLink\u003e0 Fee Fest\u003c/zeroFeeLink\u003e, including popular Futures like \u003csolFuturesLink\u003eSOLUSDT Perpetual\u003c/solFuturesLink\u003e and trending TradFi Futures such as Stocks and OIL.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q3_question\":\"Which crypto exchange has the lowest trading fees?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q3_answer_p1\":\"MEXC consistently ranks as the \u003ca\u003elowest-fee crypto exchange\u003c/a\u003e among major centralized platforms. Here's how base-tier rates compare in 2026:\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q3_table_note\":\"The trading fees data between different crypto exchanges is retrieved on April 2026.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q3_answer_p2\":\"What sets MEXC apart as a zero-fee crypto exchange is accessibility: 0% maker fees are available to all users from day one, with no volume thresholds, no VIP tier requirements, and no need to hold a native platform token to qualify.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_question\":\"How can I buy and sell crypto without paying fees?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p1\":\"The simplest way is to use a crypto exchange that offers zero trading fees as a platform-wide standard, not a limited-time promo or a subscription add-on. On MEXC, all Spot trading pairs already carry 0% maker and taker fees, and 100+ Futures pairs are included in the \u003czeroFeeLink\u003e0 Fee Fest\u003c/zeroFeeLink\u003e with 0% on both sides. No coupon codes, no native token holding requirements, and no minimum volume to unlock the rate.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p2\":\"Here's how to get started:\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p3\":\"Step 1: Sign up at \u003ca\u003emexc.com\u003c/a\u003e with your email or phone number and complete identity verification.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p4\":\"Step 2: Fund your account. Deposit crypto directly, or buy crypto using a credit/debit card, bank transfer, or P2P trading.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p5\":\"Step 3: Start trading.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p6\":\"For Spot, go to the \u003ca\u003eBTC/USDT trading page\u003c/a\u003e (or any Spot pair). Place a limit order or market order and pay $0 in trading fees.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p7\":\"For Futures, head to \u003ca\u003eMEXC Futures\u003c/a\u003e and choose from 100+ zero-fee contracts. If you want to make sure your order always enters the book as a maker order, use the \u003cpostOnlyLink\u003ePost-Only mode\u003c/postOnlyLink\u003e.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q4_answer_p8\":\"Zero-fee rates apply automatically once your account is set up. No event registration is required.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q5_question\":\"Are there other costs besides trading fees when using a zero-fee crypto exchange?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q5_answer_p1\":\"There are no hidden markups, no subscription fees, and no account maintenance charges on MEXC.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q5_answer_p2\":\"However, there are other fees to be aware of, such as withdrawal fees and spread.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q5_answer_p3\":\"Withdrawal fees: Moving crypto off any exchange to an external wallet incurs a network fee. On MEXC, withdrawal fees closely reflect the actual blockchain cost, and you can choose the cheapest network (e.g., TRC20 or Solana for USDT instead of ERC20) to minimize charges. All crypto deposits on MEXC are free.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q5_answer_p4\":\"Spread: The bid-ask spread is the difference between the highest buy price and the lowest sell price on the order book. This exists on every exchange and is driven by market liquidity, not by the platform. MEXC's high trading volume and deep order books help keep spreads tight on major pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q6_question\":\"What is the difference between a maker fee and a taker fee in crypto?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q6_answer_p1\":\"A maker places a limit order at a price that doesn't match right away. A taker places an order that fills instantly against existing orders in the book, removing liquidity.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q6_answer_p2\":\"Maker: The order sits in the order book waiting for a counterparty, which adds liquidity to the market. For example, if BTC is trading at $80,000 and you place a buy order at $79,500, your order enters the book and waits. When it eventually fills, the maker fee applies.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q6_answer_p3\":\"Taker: Taker removes liquidity as it fulfills existing orders. It happens with market orders or limit orders priced at or beyond the current market price.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q6_answer_p4\":\"Most exchange charge makers less than takers, because maker orders improve the depth and quality of the order book. On MEXC, both roles benefit from industry-leading rates: all Spot pairs carry 0% for both makers and takers. For Futures, MEXC's standard base rate is 0% maker / 0.04% taker, and eligible \u003czeroFeeLink\u003e0 Fee Fest\u003c/zeroFeeLink\u003e pairs offer 0% on both sides.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q7_question\":\"How much do crypto trading fees actually cost per year?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q7_answer_p1\":\"More than most traders realize. In 2025 alone, \u003csavingsLink\u003eMEXC's zero-fee strategy saved 3.44 million users a combined 1.1 billion USDT in trading costs\u003c/savingsLink\u003e across 3,000+ Spot and Futures pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q7_answer_p2\":\"Here's what annual trading fee costs look like at different volume levels:\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q7_table_note\":\"The MEXC column reflects 0% maker and taker on Spot pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q7_answer_p3\":\"On an exchange charging 0.1% per trade (the industry standard at Binance, Bybit, and KuCoin), a trader executing $20,000 in monthly Spot volume pays about $480 per year in fees. On platforms like Coinbase, where entry-tier taker fees reach 0.6%, that same volume costs $2,880 per year.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q7_answer_p4\":\"For active traders, switching to a zero-fee platform is one of the fastest ways to improve net returns without changing any part of your trading strategy.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q8_question\":\"Is a zero-fee crypto exchange safe to use?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q8_answer_p1\":\"Yes, as long as the exchange backs its zero-fee model with real infrastructure. Low fees alone don't indicate weak security, and high fees don't guarantee strong security. These are independent variables.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q8_answer_p2\":\"MEXC maintains institutional-grade security alongside its zero-fee structure. The platform holds a $684M insurance fund, publishes \u003cporLink\u003e100%+ verified Proof of Reserves\u003c/porLink\u003e, enforces mandatory two-factor authentication (2FA) on all accounts, stores the majority of user assets in cold wallets, and undergoes regular third-party security audits. Full KYC verification is required for all users, consistent with industry-wide regulatory standards in 2026.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q9_question\":\"How does MEXC sustain zero fees?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q9_answer_p1\":\"Through operational efficiency and scale. The platform processes billions in daily trading volume. Lower fees attract more users, which deepens liquidity, which attracts more volume, creating a self-reinforcing cycle that sustains the business model without compromising security or passing hidden costs to traders.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q9_answer_p2\":\"In Q1 2026, MEXC recorded net \u003cinflowsLink\u003ecapital inflows among the top 5 exchanges\u003c/inflowsLink\u003e tracked by DeFiLlama and won the \u003cawardLink\u003e\\\"Fastest Growing Exchange\\\" award\u003c/awardLink\u003e at the TokenInsight Awards 2025.\",\"mc-zero-fee-countdown-ended\":\"Ends in {days}D {hours}:{minutes}:{seconds}\",\"mc-zero-fee-countdown-started\":\"{days}D {hours}:{minutes}:{seconds}\",\"mc-zero-fee-upcoming-modal-title\":\"0-Fee Coming Soon\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_invite_title\":\"Share limited-time events\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_poster_title\":\"MEXC is holding a \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cspan\u003elimited-time event\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eJoin now!\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_poster_desc\":\"0 Fees, 100 Pairs—Trade Without Limits\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_invite_code\":\"Referral Code\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_invite_link\":\"Event Link\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_invite_link_desc\":\"Join the limited-time event on MEXC! Enjoy zero fees on up to 100 tokens. Join us!\",\"mc_zero_fee_leverage_fee_mode_title\":\"0-Fee Leverage\",\"mc_zero_fee_max_leverage_title\":\"Max Leverage\",\"mc-zero-fee-upcoming-banner-text-one\":\"0-fee event for {symbol} Futures pair is coming soon\",\"mc-zero-fee-upcoming-banner-text-two\":\"0-fee event for {symbol1}, {symbol2} Futures pairs is coming soon\",\"mc-zero-fee-upcoming-banner-text-three\":\"0-fee event for {symbol1}, {symbol2}, {symbol3} Futures pairs is coming soon\",\"mc-zero-fee-upcoming-banner-text-few\":\"0-fee event for {totalAmount} Futures pairs is coming soon, including {symbol1}, {symbol2}, {symbol3}\",\"mc-zero-fee-view-more\":\"Learn More\",\"mc_zero_fee_search\":\"Enter token name\",\"mc-zero-fee-tab-favorites\":\"Favorites\",\"mc-zero-fee-tab-positions\":\"Positions\",\"mc_zero_fee_banner_title\":\"0-Fee Fest\",\"mc_zero_fee_banner_sub_title\":\"Enjoy 0 fees on hot Futures pairs, including Stocks and trending crypto\",\"mc_zero_fee_real_fee_tip\":\"Rates may vary. Please log in to view the actual rates.\",\"mc_zero_fee_banner_share\":\"Refer to Earn\",\"mc_zero_fee_convert_button\":\"Convert Now\",\"mc_zero_fee_convert_title\":\"Convert\",\"mc_zero_fee_filter_ending_soon\":\"Only show 0-fee pairs ending soon\",\"mc_zero_fee_convert_desc\":\"Quick way to convert cryptocurrencies instantly, without relying on the order book for matching.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_title\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_1\":\"Due to varying event times for each trading pair, please refer to the latest announcements for their respective end times.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_2\":\"For the actual fee rates, please refer to the information shown on the specific trading page.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_2_1\":\"Institutional accounts, market makers, project teams, and API users are not eligible for 0 fees.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_3\":\"Registration is not required. Users will enjoy 0% Maker and Taker fees when trading eligible pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_4\":\"During the event, trading fee discounts from other promotions will not apply to the above-mentioned trading pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_4_1\":\"During the event, if an account triggers risk control, the 0-fee benefit will be suspended until the restriction is lifted.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_5_1\":\"Eligibility of 0-fee trading volume is subject to the rules of each event. Please refer to the relevant event page for details.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_7\":\"Zero fees do not apply to liquidation. Once liquidation is triggered, you will lose 100% of your position margin, and the liquidation fee will be deducted from your margin.\",\"mc_zero_fee_terms_conditions_desc_6\":\"MEXC reserves the final interpretation rights for this event. For any inquiries, please contact Customer Service.\",\"mxc_fee_share_poster_save_fee_title_total\":\"Total Fees Saved on MEXC\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_save_poster\":\"Download Image\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_copy_url\":\"Copy Link\",\"mc_zero_fee_share_copy_more\":\"More\",\"mc_markets_chance_new_activity_title_1\":\"Trade New Futures: {coin1}\",\"mc_markets_chance_new_activity_title_2\":\"Trade New Futures: {coin1} \u0026 {coin2}\",\"mc_markets_chance_new_activity_title_3\":\"Trade New Futures: {coin1}, {coin2} \u0026 {coin3}\",\"mc_markets_chance_new_activity_title_more\":\"Trade New Futures: {coin1}, {coin2}, {coin3} \u0026 More\",\"mc_markets_chance_hot_activity_title_1\":\"Trade Hot Futures: {coin1}\",\"mc_markets_chance_hot_activity_title_2\":\"Trade Hot Futures: {coin1} \u0026 {coin2}\",\"mc_markets_chance_hot_activity_title_3\":\"Trade Hot Futures: {coin1}, {coin2} \u0026 {coin3}\",\"mc_markets_chance_hot_activity_title_more\":\"Trade Hot Futures: {coin1}, {coin2}, {coin3} \u0026 More\",\"mc_markets_chance_signup_popup_title_1\":\"Trade {coin1} Futures to Share {awardPool}\",\"mc_markets_chance_signup_popup_title_2\":\"Trade {coin1} \u0026 {coin2} Futures to Share {awardPool}\",\"mc_markets_chance_signup_popup_title_3\":\"Trade {coin1}, {coin2} \u0026 {coin3} Futures to Share {awardPool}\",\"mc_markets_chance_signup_popup_title_more\":\"Trade {coin1}, {coin2}, {coin3} \u0026 More Futures to Share {awardPool}\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_seo_title\":\"MEXC 0-Fee Calculator: Calculate How Much Money You Saved on Futures Trading\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_seo_desc\":\"Find out exactly how much money you've saved with MEXC's 0-fee trading. Enter your trade volume and instantly calculate your fees saved compared to standard exchange fees.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_savings_sub_title\":\"See Fees You Can Save in 1 Year\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q17_question\":\"I was eligible for 0 fees before. Why not now?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q17_answer_p1\":\"Possible reasons include:\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q17_answer_p2\":\"Your current 0-fee trading volume quota for that pair has been fully used\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q17_answer_p3\":\"After a regular evaluation, your account did not meet the criteria for this cycle\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q17_answer_p4\":\"Your account has triggered risk review measures\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q17_answer_p5\":\"0 fees allocation and adjustment are dynamic. Keep trading normally awill help you regain 0 fees in future cycles.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q18_question\":\"Can I cancel my 0-fee benefit?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q18_answer\":\"Yes. If you do not wish to use this benefit, you can submit a cancelation request via this \u003ca\u003eform\u003c/a\u003e. Your request will be processed within 48 hours. If you wish to enjoy 0 fees again, you will need to wait for the next system evaluation.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_main_title\":\"How much can you save with MEXC 0-Fee?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_sub_title\":\"0 fees on hot Futures pairs. Trade more. Pay less.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_cta\":\"Trade at 0-Fee Now\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_result_label\":\"Estimated fees saved over {period} (USDT)\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_result_note\":\"*Estimates are based on a taker fee of {standardTR}. Actual fees saved depend on the specific order fees.\",\"mc_zero_fee_page_tab_calculator\":\"0-Fee Calculator\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_disclaimer_label\":\"Disclaimer:\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_disclaimer_text\":\"This calculator is provided for informational purposes only. Results are estimates based on user-inputted data and do not constitute financial advice. Fee comparisons are based on publicly available rates from third-party exchanges and are subject to change. MEXC's 0 fees programme terms may be updated at any time without prior notice. Always refer to the official MEXC fee page for current rates and eligibility conditions.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_col_platform\":\"Platform\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_col_max_fee\":\"Max Fee per $10,000 Traded\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_comparison_title\":\"Industry-Leading Trading Fees\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_comparison_subtitle\":\"Save up to {maxSavedAmount} USDT for every 10,000 USDT traded\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_col_maker\":\"Maker Fee\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_col_taker\":\"Taker Fee\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_free\":\"FREE\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_add_other\":\"Other Fees\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_experience_zero_fee\":\"Experience 0-Fee Now\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_q1\":\"What does 0-fee crypto trading mean?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_a1\":\"0-fee trading means you pay no maker or taker fees when you open or close a trade. On most exchanges, these fees range from 0.02% to 0.1% per trade. However, MEXC eliminates these, so your full position value works for you in every trade. \u003clink\u003eLearn more about MEXC's fee structure now\u003c/link\u003e!\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_q2\":\"How do I use the MEXC Futures fee calculator?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_a2\":\"Enter your estimated trading volume, and the calculator instantly shows you how much you save in fees compared to standard-rate exchanges. Try using the Futures fee calculator now.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_q3\":\"Are there any hidden fees on MEXC's 0-fee trading?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_a3\":\"MEXC charges 0% maker and taker fees on selected spot and futures trading with no hidden charges on your trade volume. Funding rates and spreads still apply as they do on any derivatives exchange, but there are no platform fees cutting into your positions. Explore the \u003clink\u003efull list of 0-fee trading pairs\u003c/link\u003e now.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_q4\":\"Who is eligible for MEXC's 0-fee Futures trading?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_a4\":\"All registered MEXC users with an active Futures account are automatically eligible. There are no applications, no minimum deposit, no tier requirements. You just need to \u003clink\u003ecreate an account\u003c/link\u003e, complete verification, and activate your Futures account to start trading at 0% fees.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_q5\":\"How much can I save with 0% Futures trading fees?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_a5\":\"It depends on your volume. A trader doing $50,000 in monthly Futures volume on an exchange charging 0.05% taker fees pays \u003cb\u003e$25\u003c/b\u003e every month in fees alone, \u003cb\u003e$300\u003c/b\u003e a year. At MEXC, that cost is \u003cb\u003e$0\u003c/b\u003e. Use the MEXC Futures fee calculator to run the numbers against your own trading activity.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_q6\":\"How do I enable 0-fee Futures trading on MEXC?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_a6\":\"Simply sign up and log in to your MEXC account, complete KYC verification, and open a Futures account. The 0-fee trading eligibility will be automatically activated for you. You can enjoy 0-fee trading directly on supported Futures pairs without any additional application or registration.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_stats_title\":\"MEXC Has Saved Global Users Over\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_stats_total_saved\":\"Total Fees Saved\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_stats_users\":\"Users Enjoyed 0 Fees\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_stats_pairs\":\"0-Fee Futures Pairs\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_stats_note\":\"*Data calculated since {date}\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_pairs_title\":\"0 Fees Trading on Hot Futures\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_view_full_list\":\"View Full List\",\"mc_zero_fee_page_tab_fest\":\"0-Fee Fest\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_new_feature_guide\":\"See how much you'll save with 0 fees\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_share_poster_desc\":\"Scan to see fees you can save\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_daily_volume\":\"Daily Futures Trading Volume\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_btn\":\"Calculate\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_period_year\":\"{year}Y\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_period_month\":\"{month}M\",\"mxc_fee_share_poster_save_fee_title_year\":\"Savings over {period} year at {volume}/day\",\"mxc_fee_share_poster_save_fee_title_years\":\"Savings over {period} years at {volume}/day\",\"mxc_fee_share_poster_save_fee_title_month\":\"Savings over {period} month at {volume}/day\",\"mxc_fee_share_poster_save_fee_title_months\":\"Savings over {period} months at {volume}/day\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_what_is_q\":\"What is MEXC 0-fee Futures trading?\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_faq_what_is_a\":\"MEXC's 0-fee program gives you 0% maker and taker fees on Futures trades. No percentage cuts or volume-based hidden fees. Your profits stay yours.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_comparison_section_title\":\"Maximize Profits with 0 Fees\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_comparison_section_subtitle\":\"Say goodbye to hidden fees and enjoy zero trading fees on MEXC. Try the Futures Fee Calculator to see exactly how much you can save.\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_pairs_section_title\":\"Hot Futures Pairs\",\"mc_zero_fee_calculator_pairs_section_desc\":\"The 0-fee offer covers hot Futures pairs and trending crypto. It is not just few select pairs.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q10_question\":\"Why am I not eligible for 0 fees on a certain pair?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q11_question\":\"Will 0 fees be applied to my account automatically?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q12_question\":\"Do 0 fees have an expiry date?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q13_question\":\"Is there a maximum trading volume for 0 fees?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q14_question\":\"For pairs with a maximum trading volume, does my 0-fee trading volume quota change?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q15_question\":\"How is my 0-fee trading volume quota used?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q16_question\":\"What happens after my 0-fee trading volume quota is used up?\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q10_answer\":\"0-fee eligibility is granted automatically after regular system evaluations. Eligibility is based on factors such as your account status, trading activity, effective trading volume, risk review, and market conditions. Not having 0 fees does not mean there is an issue with your account. It simply means you did not meet the criteria in the current cycle. Keep trading normally and the system will continue to review your account.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q11_answer\":\"Yes. Once you qualify, 0 fees will be applied to your account automatically. You do not need to claim them, and you can start trading immediately. On the Futures trading page, look for the 0 Fees label on the relevant pair.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q12_answer\":\"Some pairs do. Each pair's 0-fee allocation comes with a validity period, and any unused trading volume quota will be forfeited when it expires. You can view the usage progress and expiry time for each pair on this page.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q13_answer\":\"For some pairs, yes. Certain pairs have a maximum trading volume that is eligible for 0 fees. Please refer to the 0 Fees event page or the Futures trading page for details.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q14_answer\":\"Yes. Based on your account status, trading activity, market conditions, and risk review, the system may adjust your 0-fee maximum trading volume periodically. This may include increasing, reducing, or removing your trading volume quota. These adjustments are part of the regular system evaluation.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q15_answer\":\"Your quota is used according to your trading volume. For each trade, the effective trading volume will be deducted from the 0-fee trading volume quota for that pair. Once the quota is fully used, trades on that pair will revert to the standard fee rate. You can confirm whether 0 fees are still active for a pair by checking the 0 Fees label on the Futures trading page.\",\"mc_zero_fee_faq_q16_answer\":\"After your trading volume quota is used up, subsequent trades will be charged at the standard fee rate. In the next evaluation cycle, the system will decide whether to grant additional 0-fee trading volume quota to your account.\",\"mc_zero_fee_my_exclusive_quota_title\":\"My Exclusive 0-Fee Quota\",\"mc_zero_fee_perpetual\":\"Futures\",\"mc_zero_fee_remaining_quota\":\"Remaining Quota\",\"mc_zero_fee_quota_exhausted\":\"Quota Used Up\",\"mc_zero_fee_quota_exhausted_tip\":\"After your 0-fee quota is used up, subsequent trades will be charged at the standard fee rate, even if the 0-fee event has not yet ended\",\"mc_zero_fee_shared_quota_all_tooltip\":\"All trading pairs share this maximum trading volume\",\"mc_zero_fee_shared_quota_exclude_tooltip\":\"All trading pairs share this maximum trading volume, except: {symbols}\",\"mc_zero_fee_shared_quota_tooltip\":\"Pairs sharing this maximum trading volume: {symbols}\",\"mc_zero_fee_total_quota\":\"Max Trading Vol\",\"mc_zero_fee_shared_total_quota\":\"Shared Max Trading Vol\",\"mc_zero_fee_trade_low_fee\":\"Trade at Low Fees\",\"mc_zero_fee_exclusive_go_trade\":\"Trade Now\",\"mc_zero_fee_countdown_ended_quota_source_title\":\"Ends in\",\"mc_zero_fee_countdown_ended_quota_source\":\"{days}\u003cspan\u003eD\u003c/span\u003e {hours}\u003cspan\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e{minutes}\u003cspan\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e{seconds}\",\"mc_zero_fee_countdown_ended_quota_source_hide_days\":\"{hours}\u003cspan\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e{minutes}\u003cspan\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e{seconds}\",\"mc_avatar_rules_content\":\"1. Pick an image and upload it.\u003cbr/\u003e\\n2. Generate your personalized AI avatar using MEXC AI.\u003cbr/\u003e\\n3. Change your X avatar and share your AI avatar in a post.\u003cbr/\u003e\\n4. Share your AI avatar in the comments of the pinned activity post on \u003clink1\u003e{name1}(@MEXC_Official)\u003c/link1\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\\n5. Fill out the \u003clink2\u003e{name2}\u003c/link2\u003e with your UID, X profile link, and post link.\",\"mc_avatar_rule_3_link_name\":\"MEXC's Official X\",\"mc_avatar_rule_4_link_name\":\"Google Form\",\"mc_avatar_rules_title\":\"How to Participate\",\"mc_avatar_rules_view_details\":\"Event Rules\",\"mc_avatar_rules_view_details_content\":\"$64\",\"mc_avatar_share\":\"Share\",\"mc_avatar_main_title\":\"Create Your 0-Fee Avatar to Split \u003cspan\u003e$60,000 GOLD\u003c/span\u003e\",\"mc_avatar_landing_subtitle\":\"Make a personalized avatar \u0026 share it to unlock rewards\",\"mc_avatar_event_period_2\":\"Feb 2, 2026 – Feb 13, 2026\",\"mc_avatar_landing_event_period_2\":\"Event Period: Feb 2, 2026 – Feb 13, 2026\",\"mc_avatar_btn_share_win\":\"Split $60,000 GOLD\",\"mc_avatar_share_scan_qr\":\"Create your avatar \u0026 split $60,000 GOLD\",\"mc_avatar_share_text\":\"Just made my 0-Fee AI avatar on MEXC! 😎 Come generate yours \u0026 share $60K GOLD rewards!\",\"mc_avatar_some_error\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again later.\",\"mc_avatar_landing_button\":\"Generate My Avatar\",\"mc_avatar_btn_get_rewards\":\"Claim 10,000 USDT\",\"mc_avatar_btn_register_get_10000u\":\"Sign Up for 10,000 USDT\",\"mc_avatar_daily_limit\":\"You can generate up to \u003cspan\u003e{number}\u003c/span\u003e avatars per day\",\"mc_avatar_btn_replace\":\"Replace\",\"mc_avatar_btn_download\":\"Download\",\"mc_avatar_step_upload\":\"Pick your image\",\"mc_avatar_style_select_title\":\"Pick your desired style\",\"mc_avatar_processing_title\":\"You're next in the line...\",\"mc_avatar_upload_error\":\"Image does not meet requirements. Please upload another one.\",\"mc_avatar_btn_generate\":\"Generate\",\"mc_avatar_upload_error_size\":\"Image size cannot exceed 5 MB\",\"mc_avatar_generating_avatar\":\"Customizing your avatar...\",\"mc_avatar_btn_delete\":\"Delete\",\"mc_avatar_upload_update_placeholder\":\"Upload Image\",\"mc_avatar_upload_hint\":\"Supported formats: JPG, PNG, JPEG \\n(max size: 5 MB)\",\"mc_activity_5h_avatar_cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"mc_activity_5h_avatar_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"mc_avatar_error_4001\":\"Daily limit reached. Please try again tomorrow.\",\"mc_asset_safety_wallet_asset\":\"MEXC Wallet Total Assets\",\"mc_asset_safety_user_asset\":\"MEXC Total User Assets\",\"mc_asset_safety_reserve_rate_desc\":\"Verified in real time and accessible at all times\",\"mc_asset_safety_learn_more\":\"Learn More\",\"mc_asset_safety_current_snapshot\":\"Current snapshot: \u003cspan\u003e{times}\u003c/span\u003e\",\"mexc_ai_recommended_tutorials_title\":\"Recommended Tutorials\",\"mexc_ai_landing_discover_more\":\"Discover More\",\"mc_mexcmize_cta\":\"Sign up to earn ${amount}\",\"mc_mexcmize_tdk_title\":\"Your 0-Fee Gateway to Infinite Opportunities | MEXC\",\"mc_mexcmize_tdk_description\":\"Access global assets on MEXC with zero trading fees. Seamlessly trade crypto, gold, silver, oil, and stocks. Backed by a zero-fee advantage, deep liquidity, and a robust ecosystem, MEXC helps users consistently stay ahead in any market.\",\"mc_mexcmize_tdk_alt\":\"MEXC - Your 0-Fee Gateway to Infinite Opportunities\",\"mc_mexcmize_landing_title\":\"MEXCmize Your Opportunities\",\"mc_mexcmize_landing_sub_title\":\"Your 0-Fee Gateway\u003cspan\u003eto Infinite Opportunities\u003c/span\u003e\",\"mc_mexcmize_event2_title\":\"MEXC 0-Fee Festival\",\"mc_mexcmize_event2_description\":\"Enjoy 0 fees on Spot and Futures for a limited time\",\"mc_mexcmize_join_now\":\"Join Now\",\"mc_mexcmize_event1_title\":\"MEXC 8eyond\",\"mc_mexcmize_event1_description\":\"Strategize with AI or forge your own path to ${amount}\",\"mc_mexcmize_event3_title\":\"Refer a Friend, Earn ${amount} Each\",\"mc_mexcmize_event3_description\":\"$${amount} in rewards up for grabs\",\"mc_mexcmize_event4_title\":\"MEXC Card\",\"mc_mexcmize_event4_description\":\"Earn up to {amount1}% cashback + {amount2}% APR on your balance\",\"mc_mexcmize_apply_now\":\"Apply Now\",\"mc_mexcmize_card_section_title\":\"Discover More Events\",\"mc_mexcmize_card1_title\":\"Ask MEXC CEO\",\"mc_mexcmize_card1_description\":\"Got a question for our CEO? Submit it for a chance to have it answered and win ${amount}!\",\"mc_mexcmize_ask_question\":\"Ask a Question\",\"mc_mexcmize_card2_title\":\"8eyond AI UGC Video Contest\",\"mc_mexcmize_intro_section_title\":\"Meet Our CEO\",\"mc_mexcmize_intro_sub_title\":\"Vugar Usi\",\"mc_mexcmize_ceo\":\"Chief Executive Officer\",\"mc_mexcmize_intro_desc\":\"\u003cwrapper\u003eVugar Usi leads the company's global strategy, growth, and long-term vision to build a more open and inclusive digital asset ecosystem. Prior to joining MEXC, he served as Chief Operating Officer at Bitget, where he played a key role in expanding the platform's operations and growing its global user base.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eWith over 15 years of experience in marketing, communications, and brand strategy, Vugar has worked with leading global brands including Carlsberg, Facebook, Coca-Cola, and X (formerly Twitter). He holds a Master of Public Administration from Harvard University and serves as an advisor to the United Nations Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights on minority issues.\u003c/wrapper\u003e\",\"mc_mexcmize_intro_cta\":\"Letter from CEO\",\"mc_mexcmize_event_title\":\"Trading \u0026 Referral Events\",\"mc_mexcmize_step1_title\":\"Infinite Opportunities\",\"mc_mexcmize_step2_title\":\"MEXCmize \u003cspan\u003eYour Edge\u003c/span\u003e\",\"mc_mexcmize_step1_description\":\"MEXC enables users to access global assets and unlock endless opportunities. With seamless trading in crypto, gold, silver, oil, stocks, and more, we create a boundless financial universe.\",\"mc_mexcmize_step2_description\":\"Backed by 0 fees, deep liquidity, and a strong ecosystem, MEXC helps users stay ahead in any market. With MEXC-AI, Prediction Markets, and the MEXC Card, users can act faster and gain deeper insights.\",\"mc_mexcmize_animate_title\":\"Your 0-Fee Gateway\",\"mc_mexcmize_animate_description\":\"MEXC is a global open financial platform that empowers everyone to access and amplify opportunities. With zero trading fees, we remove cost barriers so opportunities are shared worldwide.\",\"mc_risk_transparency_section2_main_title\":\"Proof of Reserves\",\"mc_home_seo_description\":\"MEXC is your 0-fee gateway to infinite opportunities. Explore the world's leading cryptocurrency exchange for buying, trading, and earning crypto. Trade Bitcoin BTC, Ethereum ETH, and more than 3,000 altcoins.\"},\"fee\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"assets\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"fund\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"user\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"futures\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"exchange\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"markets\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"notable-change\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"trading-data\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"chance\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"home\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"alpha\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"zero-fee\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"invite\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"avatar\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"events\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"mexcmize\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"mexc-ai\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"asset-safety\":\"$62:props:messages:common\",\"risk-transparency\":\"$62:props:messages:common\"},\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"Asia/Shanghai\",\"children\":[\"$L65\",\"$L66\"]}]\n67:I[263406,[\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/1j41eqdpv3o_n.js\",\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/0t4th43auteg-.js\",\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/0txl2zty07161.js\",\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/2xl30axq-eywl.js\",\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/02fhrsphm-5i_.js\",\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v4/75/_next/static/chunks/1sqcgryq912pv.js\",\"https://static.mocortech.com/prd/mxc-web-main-v